        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin your journey as a one-person game developer</strong> with nothing but a simple PC and a big dream. Choose topics and genres, balance design and technology, and release your own games to earn fans and keep the lights on. Hit key milestones, unlock new tools and platforms, and gradually move from your first scrappy projects to ambitious releases. As your career grows, you’ll research new ideas, refine your development process, and make the choices that shape your path from unknown indie to renowned studio head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/274cbed3e067611490f14cc9b748e168.poster.avif?t=1764853196\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/274cbed3e067611490f14cc9b748e168.webm?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/274cbed3e067611490f14cc9b748e168.mp4?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own developer</strong> using a flexible character creator, pick their look and style, and define their strengths as a game maker. Customize their appearance, then jump into your first projects and begin building your studio’s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/8dae7f77ea34b37298d48f7816e8d7e6.poster.avif?t=1764853196\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/8dae7f77ea34b37298d48f7816e8d7e6.webm?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/8dae7f77ea34b37298d48f7816e8d7e6.mp4?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research new topics, genres and engine features to keep your studio evolving</strong>. Spend research points to unlock fresh ideas, experiment with new combinations, and open up more ways to design games that stand out, reach different audiences, and push your career forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/54a66f14a6b3d1505195bceb9de4ae65.poster.avif?t=1764853196\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/54a66f14a6b3d1505195bceb9de4ae65.webm?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/54a66f14a6b3d1505195bceb9de4ae65.mp4?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own game engines</strong>, choosing the features and tech level that fit your projects. Invest time and money into better tools, then plug your custom engine into future games to boost quality, unlock new possibilities and stay ahead of the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/728118091e40e62bede75df05eb42115.poster.avif?t=1764853196\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/728118091e40e62bede75df05eb42115.webm?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/728118091e40e62bede75df05eb42115.mp4?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new offices and grow your studio</strong> from a cramped starter room into a bustling development space. Move into bigger buildings, add more desks and equipment, and turn your once tiny setup into a professional studio that can handle larger teams, bigger projects and more ambitious games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/595cbbff1898d4b2d61272b7a4f07c86.poster.avif?t=1764853196\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/595cbbff1898d4b2d61272b7a4f07c86.webm?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/595cbbff1898d4b2d61272b7a4f07c86.mp4?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you’re chasing perfect review scores, experimenting with risky ideas or just watching your tiny studio slowly grow, Game Dev Life lets you build your own path through the games industry at your own pace. Plan smart, learn from your failures, celebrate your hits, and see how far your career can go.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin your journey as a one-person game developer</strong> with nothing but a simple PC and a big dream. Choose topics and genres, balance design and technology, and release your own games to earn fans and keep the lights on. Hit key milestones, unlock new tools and platforms, and gradually move from your first scrappy projects to ambitious releases. As your career grows, you’ll research new ideas, refine your development process, and make the choices that shape your path from unknown indie to renowned studio head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/274cbed3e067611490f14cc9b748e168.poster.avif?t=1764853196\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/274cbed3e067611490f14cc9b748e168.webm?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/274cbed3e067611490f14cc9b748e168.mp4?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own developer</strong> using a flexible character creator, pick their look and style, and define their strengths as a game maker. Customize their appearance, then jump into your first projects and begin building your studio’s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/8dae7f77ea34b37298d48f7816e8d7e6.poster.avif?t=1764853196\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/8dae7f77ea34b37298d48f7816e8d7e6.webm?