_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/728118091e40e62bede75df05eb42115.webm?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/728118091e40e62bede75df05eb42115.mp4?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new offices and grow your studio</strong> from a cramped starter room into a bustling development space. Move into bigger buildings, add more desks and equipment, and turn your once tiny setup into a professional studio that can handle larger teams, bigger projects and more ambitious games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/595cbbff1898d4b2d61272b7a4f07c86.poster.avif?t=1764853196\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/595cbbff1898d4b2d61272b7a4f07c86.webm?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184910/extras/595cbbff1898d4b2d61272b7a4f07c86.mp4?t=1764853196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you’re chasing perfect review scores, experimenting with risky ideas or just watching your tiny studio slowly grow, Game Dev Life lets you build your own path through the games industry at your own pace. Plan smart, learn from your failures, celebrate your hits, and see how far your career can go.</i></p>",
